OL,3,AThe Peruvian city that has embraced
OL,4,APope Leo as one of its own
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV has celebrated Mass near
OL,7,Fthe Peruvian city where he made his
OL,8,Fname as a compassionate bishop who
OL,9,Fworked closely with poor and migrant
OL,10,Fcommunities.
OL,12,FThe ceremony was held on Friday at a
OL,13,Fpark in Pimentel, about 10km (six
OL,14,Fmiles) from Chiclayo in northern Peru
OL,15,Fas part of his tour of Latin America.
OL,17,FThe Vatican estimates more than 1.5
OL,18,Fmillion people gathered to welcome the
OL,19,Fpontiff.
OL,21,F"Thank you for your affection, support
OL,22,Fand prayers," the Pope told followers.
